libcds2
------------------------------------------
Compressed Data Structure Library

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcds2-devel-2.0+git20150418-1bl2
  libcds2_2-2.0+git20150418-1bl2
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/fclaude/libcds2

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/fclaude/libcds2.git

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libcds2-2.0+git20150418-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libcds2-2.0+git20150418-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libcds2-2.0+git20150418-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcds2-fclaude-2.0+git20150418-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcds2_2-2.0+git20150418-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libcds2-devel-2.0+git20150418-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

